---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import BurgerGallery from '../components/BurgerGallery.astro';
import { site, whatsapp } from '../data/site';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="hero-image"><img src="/images/hero-burger.webp" alt="Imagem ilustrativa de burger artesanal com pão dourado e cheddar derretido" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" /></div>
    <div class="hero-neon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 820 650" fill="none" focusable="false">
        <path class="neon-tube tube-cyan" d="M275 36H650C724 36 784 96 784 170V385" />
        <path class="neon-tube tube-violet" d="M38 390V455C38 524 94 580 163 580H522" />
        <path class="tube-core" d="M275 36H650C724 36 784 96 784 170V385M38 390V455C38 524 94 580 163 580H522" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow"><span class="tiny-dot"></span>DA ORLA. DA RUA. DO 013.</span>
        <h1 id="hero-title" class="display">SUA FOME<br />TEM CEP.<br /><span class="hero-013">013<span class="hero-period">.</span></span></h1>
        <p>Burger artesanal, alma santista.<br />O próximo rolê começa com uma mordida.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button button-cyan" href="/cardapio/">Conheça os burgers<Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></a><a class="hero-secondary" href={whatsapp()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><Icon name="whatsapp" size={19} />Bora pedir</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-seal" aria-label="O Burguer 013, Santos, São Paulo"><span>BURGER COM</span><strong>ALMA<br />SANTISTA</strong><span>23°58′ S · 46°19′ W</span></div>
      <div class="hero-bottom"><span><Icon name="pin" size={14} />EMBARÉ · SANTOS, SP</span><a href="#burgers">DESÇA COM FOME<Icon name="down" size={15} /></a><span class="hero-bottom-right">ARTESANAL POR NATUREZA.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="brand-ticker" aria-label="Burger na chapa. Santos na alma. O Burguer 013."><div class="ticker-track" aria-hidden="true">{[0,1,2,3].map(() => <span>BURGER NA CHAPA<Icon name="burger" size={26} />SANTOS NA ALMA<Icon name="spark" size={26} />O BURGUER 013<Icon name="burger" size={26} /></span>)}</div></div>

  <section class="burger-section container" id="burgers">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow text-cyan">ESCOLHA SEU PRÓXIMO ROLÊ</span><h2 class="display">DIFÍCIL É<br /><span class="outlined">FICAR SÓ OLHANDO.</span></h2></div><div><p>Tem o clássico, tem o Egg e tem a pegada vegetal. Qual combina com a sua fome?</p><a class="text-link" href="/cardapio/">Explorar os burgers<Icon name="northeast" size={17} /></a></div></div>
    <BurgerGallery />
    <div class="menu-callout"><div><Icon name="whatsapp" size={24} /><p>Quer o cardápio completo?<span>Peça os valores e as opções de hoje direto com a gente.</span></p></div><a class="text-link" href={whatsapp()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Me manda o cardápio<Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="essence-section" id="essencia">
    <div class="container essence-grid">
      <div class="craft-photo" data-reveal><img src="/images/burger-craft.webp" alt="Imagem ilustrativa de burger com queijo sobre a chapa" width="1536" height="1024" loading="lazy" /><div class="photo-caption"><span>O CALOR DA CHAPA.</span><span>A NOSSA PEGADA.</span></div><span class="craft-stamp">013<br /><small>SANTOS / SP</small></span></div>
      <div class="essence-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow text-violet">MUITO MAIS QUE UM ENDEREÇO</span><h2 class="display">A RUA É NOSSA.<br />A FOME<br /><span class="text-cyan">É SUA.</span></h2><p>Tem coisa que combina com Santos: a brisa da orla, a conversa sem pressa e um burger caprichado no fim do dia.</p><p>O Burguer 013 carrega essa pegada. Artesanal, descomplicado e com a identidade de quem tem o 013 no nome e a cidade na alma.</p><div class="essence-points"><span><Icon name="burger" />BURGER ARTESANAL</span><span><Icon name="pin" />ALMA DO EMBARÉ</span></div><a class="text-link" href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cola no nosso Instagram<Icon name="northeast" size={17} /></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="how-section container" data-reveal>
    <div class="how-title"><span class="eyebrow text-cyan">SEM COMPLICAÇÃO</span><h2 class="display">DEU FOME?<br />CHAMA O 013.</h2></div>
    <div class="how-steps"><div class="how-step"><span>01</span><div><h3>Escolha sua pegada.</h3><p>Dê uma olhada nos burgers e escolha por onde começar.</p></div><Icon name="burger" size={25} /></div><div class="how-step"><span>02</span><div><h3>Chama no WhatsApp.</h3><p>Veja o cardápio do dia, os valores e as formas de receber.</p></div><Icon name="whatsapp" size={25} /></div><div class="how-step"><span>03</span><div><h3>Combine. Peça. Curta.</h3><p>A equipe confirma o atendimento e todos os detalhes com você.</p></div><Icon name="check" size={25} /></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="location-section" id="encontre">
    <div class="container location-grid">
      <div class="location-copy" data-reveal><span class="eyebrow">O NOSSO PONTO NO MAPA</span><h2 class="display">QUEM É DO 013<br />SABE O CAMINHO.</h2><div class="address-line"><Icon name="pin" size={23} /><div><strong>{site.address}</strong><p>{site.neighborhood}<br />Ao lado da Igreja do Embaré.</p></div></div><div class="hours-line"><Icon name="clock" size={22} /><p>Vai colar por aqui?<br /><a href={whatsapp('Olá! Gostaria de confirmar o horário e o local de atendimento do O Burguer 013 hoje.')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Confirme o atendimento de hoje com a gente.<Icon name="northeast" size={13} /></a></p></div><div class="location-buttons"><a href={site.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button-dark"><Icon name="pin" size={18} />Abrir no Maps<Icon name="northeast" size={16} /></a><a href={site.waze} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="button button-map">Ir de Waze<Icon name="northeast" size={16} /></a></div></div>
      <a class="location-poster" href={site.maps} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Abrir localização do O Burguer 013 no Google Maps"><span class="poster-top">LITORAL PAULISTA<br />SANTOS, SP</span><span class="poster-city display">EMBARÉ</span><div class="poster-pin"><Icon name="pin" size={42} /></div><svg class="wave-lines" viewBox="0 0 600 270" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M-30 100C80 0 140 200 270 100S440 0 630 100M-30 130C80 30 140 230 270 130S440 30 630 130M-30 160C80 60 140 260 270 160S440 60 630 160M-30 190C80 90 140 290 270 190S440 90 630 190M-30 220C80 120 140 320 270 220S440 120 630 220" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" /></svg><div class="poster-bottom"><span>O BURGUER 013<br /><small>DA ORLA PRA SUA FOME.</small></span><Icon name="northeast" size={27} /></div></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="social-section container" data-reveal><div><span class="eyebrow text-violet">A GENTE SE ENCONTRA NO FEED</span><h2 class="display">SEGUE O 013.<br /><span class="outlined">A FOME VEM JUNTO.</span></h2></div><div class="social-cta"><a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="instagram-round" aria-label="Abrir Instagram do O Burguer 013"><Icon name="instagram" size={43} /></a><a href={site.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-link">{site.handle}<Icon name="northeast" size={17} /></a></div></section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero { position: relative; min-height: 690px; overflow: hidden; background: #090c10; isolation: isolate; }
  .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 1; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 92% 5%, #901eea24, transparent 38%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 5% 85%, #1cbfd415, transparent 39%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-neon { position: absolute; z-index: 1; width: 65%; height: 100%; right: 0; top: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-neon svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: visible; }
  .neon-tube { stroke-width: 3; stroke-linecap: round; }
  .tube-cyan { stroke: var(--color-cyan); filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px #67e7ec) drop-shadow(0 0 17px #0bbad080); }
  .tube-violet { stroke: #c693ff; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px #ad6cff) drop-shadow(0 0 18px #e65bff80); }
  .tube-core { stroke: #efffff; stroke-width: .9; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: .9; }
  .hero-image { position: absolute; width: 78%; height: 100%; top: 0; right: 0; }
  .hero-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 70% 56%; }
  .hero-image::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #090c10 0%, #090c1090 15%, #090c1000 45%), linear-gradient(0deg, #090c10 0%, transparent 28%); }
  .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; padding-top: 62px; min-height: 690px; padding-bottom: 98px; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; width: 52%; }
  .hero-eyebrow { color: #c5c9ca; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .19em; }
  .hero-eyebrow::before { display: none; }
  .tiny-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-cyan); box-shadow: 0 0 15px #67e7ec70; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(80px, 8.8vw, 131px); margin: 26px 0 18px; line-height: .87; }
  .hero-013 { font-size: 1.16em; color: #d9ffff; letter-spacing: -.01em; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.4px var(--color-cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 9px #67e7eca6, 0 0 29px #31dce754, 0 0 60px #24c8e12b; }
  .hero-period { color: #c99aff; -webkit-text-stroke-color: #d3b5ff; text-shadow: 0 0 9px #a97bf4a0, 0 0 28px #d84df14d; }
  @supports (-webkit-text-stroke: 1px #fff) {
    .hero-013 { color: #0c1c27; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.8px #caffff; }
  }
  .hero-copy > p { font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.85; color: #c0c3c7; margin: 24px 0 26px; }
  .hero-buttons { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 25px; }
  .hero-secondary { font-size: 12px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .hero-secondary:hover { color: var(--color-cyan); }
  .hero-seal { position: absolute; right: -8px; top: 59px; z-index: 2; border: 1.5px solid #b0ffff; border-radius: 50%; width: 126px; height: 126px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-direction: column; transform: rotate(13deg); color: #a5faff; background: #091316bf; box-shadow: 0 0 0 7px #0b0d1040, 0 0 0 8px #67e7ec80, 0 0 15px #67e7ec70, 0 0 45px #56d7ff24, inset 0 0 20px #67e7ec12; }
  .hero-seal span { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .15em; }
  .hero-seal strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 27px; line-height: 1; text-align: center; margin: 7px 0; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #67e7ec65; }
  .hero-bottom { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 28px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 20px; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .14em; color: #9b9fa8; }
  .hero-bottom span, .hero-bottom a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; }
  .hero-bottom a { color: #dadce0; }
  .brand-ticker { position: relative; z-index: 2; background: var(--color-cyan); color: var(--color-ink); height: 63px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; border-block: 1px solid #c2ffff; box-shadow: 0 -5px 25px #67e7ec24, 0 6px 30px #67e7ec14; }
  .ticker-track { display: flex; width: max-content; }
  .ticker-track > span { display: flex; gap: 35px; align-items: center; white-space: nowrap; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 25px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .02em; padding-right: 35px; }
  .ticker-star { font-size: 31px; line-height: 1; }
  @keyframes ticker { to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  .burger-section { padding-top: 95px; padding-bottom: 84px; }
  .outlined { color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px #c5e9ed; text-shadow: 0 0 15px #67e7ec20; }
  .menu-callout { margin-top: 37px; padding: 26px 0 0; border-top: 1px solid #ffffff1e; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 25px; align-items: center; }
  .menu-callout > div { display: flex; gap: 17px; align-items: center; }
  .menu-callout > div > svg { color: var(--color-cyan); }
  .menu-callout p { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; }
  .menu-callout p span { display: block; color: var(--color-muted); font-size: 10px; }
  .essence-section { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 93% 35%, #6c239d17, transparent 50%), #12161b; padding: 88px 0; border-block: 1px solid #a97bf426; }
  .essence-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 85px; }
  .craft-photo { position: relative; height: 570px; border-radius: 5px; box-shadow: -8px 8px 0 -7px #b98aff, -12px 12px 25px -15px #e65bff80; }
  .craft-photo > img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: 33% center; border-radius: 4px; }
  .craft-photo::after { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 60% 0 0; background: linear-gradient(0deg, #050709a0, transparent); pointer-events: none; }
  .photo-caption { position: absolute; left: 27px; bottom: 27px; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: .13em; }
  .photo-caption span:last-child { color: #bec0c6; }
  .craft-stamp { position: absolute; bottom: 42px; right: -30px; background: #0c171d; color: #c8ffff; border: 1.5px solid #9efaff; box-shadow: var(--neon-cyan), inset 0 0 18px #67e7ec15; text-shadow: 0 0 12px #67e7ec70; width: 110px; height: 110px; transform: rotate(-9deg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: 66px; line-height: .88; z-index: 2; }
  .craft-stamp small { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .14em; margin-top: 11px; }
  .essence-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(65px, 6.1vw, 88px); margin: 24px 0; }
  .essence-copy > p { color: #aeb2b9; line-height: 1.9; font-size: 12px; max-width: 380px; margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .essence-points { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 25px; padding: 24px 0; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .essence-points span { display: flex; gap: 9px; align-items: center; font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
  .essence-points svg { color: var(--color-cyan); width: 18px; }
  .how-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .95fr 1.05fr; gap: 70px; align-items: center; padding-block: 95px; }
  .how-title h2 { font-size: clamp(60px, 6vw, 87px); margin: 23px 0 0; }
  .how-step { display: flex; gap: 23px; align-items: center; padding: 27px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #ffffff24; }
  .how-step:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
  .how-step > span { color: var(--color-cyan); font-size: 10px; align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 5px; }
  .how-step > div { flex: 1; }
  .how-step h3 { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 7px; }
  .how-step p { font-size: 11px; color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.8; margin: 0; }
  .how-step > svg { color: #8c9399; }
  .location-section { background: var(--color-paper); color: var(--color-ink); padding: 80px 0; }
  .location-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.12fr 1fr; gap: 75px; align-items: center; }
  .location-copy .eyebrow { color: #555e61; }
  .location-copy h2 { font-size: clamp(55px, 5.5vw, 78px); margin: 23px 0 32px; }
  .address-line, .hours-line { display: flex; gap: 13px; margin-top: 22px; }
  .address-line strong { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
  .address-line p { color: #596068; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 6px 0 0; }
  .hours-line > p { margin: 0; color: #596068; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .hours-line a { color: #151d21; display: inline-flex; gap: 5px; align-items: center; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .location-buttons { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 30px; }
  .button-dark { background: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-paper); }
  .button-dark:hover { background: #293036; }
  .button-map { border-color: #929493; color: var(--color-ink); }
  .button-map:hover { background: #e7e0d5; }
  .location-poster { display: block; background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%, #8b299450, transparent 63%), radial-gradient(ellipse at 0% 100%, #064d662e, transparent 60%), #0d101a; color: var(--color-cyan); position: relative; height: 440px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #a97bf4; border-radius: 4px; box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #a97bf416, 0 0 27px #8b40c438; }
  .location-poster::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 13px; border: 1px solid #a97bf44d; border-radius: 2px; pointer-events: none; }
  .poster-top { position: absolute; left: 28px; top: 28px; font-size: 9px; color: #b3c1c8; letter-spacing: .13em; line-height: 1.8; }
  .poster-city { font-size: clamp(75px, 8vw, 118px); position: absolute; top: 108px; left: 27px; letter-spacing: -.01em; color: #111724; -webkit-text-stroke: 1.6px #c5ffff; text-shadow: 0 0 7px #67e7ec9e, 0 0 25px #36dcea65; }
  .poster-pin { position: absolute; z-index: 1; right: 45px; top: 210px; width: 74px; height: 74px; border: 1px solid #b0ffff; border-radius: 50%; background: #121421; display: grid; place-items: center; box-shadow: 0 0 0 17px #67e7ec08, var(--neon-cyan); }
  .wave-lines { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 4px; width: 100%; height: auto; color: var(--color-cyan); opacity: .55; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px #67e7ec60); }
  .poster-bottom { position: absolute; bottom: 27px; left: 28px; right: 28px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; color: var(--color-paper); font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.8; }
  .poster-bottom small { font-size: 7px; letter-spacing: .13em; color: #a9bac2; }
  .social-section { display: flex; gap: 45px; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding-block: 95px; }
  .social-section h2 { font-size: clamp(60px, 6vw, 87px); margin: 24px 0 0; }
  .social-cta { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 25px; align-items: center; padding-right: 35px; }
  .instagram-round { width: 105px; height: 105px; border: 1.5px solid #cfadff; border-radius: 50%; display: grid; place-items: center; color: #c9a0ff; box-shadow: var(--neon-violet), inset 0 0 24px #a97bf417; transition: background .3s, transform .3s, box-shadow .3s; }
  .instagram-round:hover { background: #a97bf418; transform: rotate(-8deg); box-shadow: 0 0 13px #b776f4a0, 0 0 40px #de47e845; }
  @media (min-width: 1500px) { .hero, .hero-content { min-height: 770px; } .hero-content { padding-top: 75px; } .hero h1 { font-size: 145px; } }
  @media (max-width: 1050px) { .hero, .hero-content { min-height: 650px; } .hero h1 { font-size: 100px; } .hero-seal { width: 100px; height: 100px; right: 0; } .hero-seal strong { font-size: 23px; } .hero-seal span { font-size: 5px; } .essence-grid, .location-grid { gap: 50px; } .craft-photo { height: 530px; } .hero-buttons { gap: 16px; } }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .hero-copy { width: 65%; } .hero-image { width: 95%; opacity: .7; } .hero-image::after { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #090c10 0%, #090c1080 45%, transparent 70%), linear-gradient(0deg,#090c10,transparent 40%); } .hero-seal { top: 40px; } .hero-bottom-right { display: none !important; } .essence-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; } .essence-copy h2 { font-size: 65px; } .craft-photo { height: 560px; } .how-section { gap: 40px; } .location-grid { gap: 35px; } .location-poster { height: 450px; } .poster-city { font-size: 74px; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .hero { min-height: 840px; }
    .hero-content { min-height: 840px; padding-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 70px; }
    .hero-copy { width: 100%; }
    .hero-eyebrow { font-size: 8px; letter-spacing: .12em; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: 87px; margin-top: 24px; }
    .hero-copy > p { font-size: 11px; margin: 17px 0 21px; }
    .hero-buttons { gap: 22px; }
    .hero-secondary { font-size: 11px; }
    .hero-image { opacity: 1; top: auto; bottom: 15px; height: 440px; width: 128%; right: -10%; }
    .hero-image img { object-position: 73% center; }
    .hero-image::after { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #090c10 0%, transparent 21%, transparent 75%, #090c10 100%); }
    .hero-neon { width: 122%; height: 390px; top: auto; bottom: 49px; right: -8%; opacity: .8; }
    .hero::before { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 33%, #8023c123, transparent 48%); }
    .hero-013 { -webkit-text-stroke-width: 1.2px; text-shadow: 0 0 8px #67e7ec80, 0 0 28px #31dce747; }
    .hero-seal { top: auto; bottom: 90px; left: -2px; right: auto; width: 88px; height: 88px; background: #0b0d10db; }
    .hero-seal strong { font-size: 20px; }
    .hero-seal span { font-size: 5px; }
    .hero-bottom { bottom: 24px; font-size: 6px; letter-spacing: .1em; }
    .brand-ticker { height: 53px; }
    .ticker-track > span { font-size: 22px; gap: 25px; padding-right: 25px; }
    .burger-section { padding-top: 62px; padding-bottom: 56px; }
    .menu-callout { display: block; }
    .menu-callout .text-link { margin-top: 21px; margin-left: 40px; font-size: 11px; }
    .essence-section { padding-block: 55px; }
    .essence-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 50px; }
    .craft-photo { width: calc(100% - 12px); margin-right: 12px; height: 405px; }
    .craft-stamp { right: -12px; width: 95px; height: 95px; font-size: 56px; }
    .essence-copy { width: 100%; }
    .essence-copy h2 { font-size: 74px; }
    .essence-copy > p { font-size: 12px; }
    .how-section { display: block; padding-block: 60px; }
    .how-title h2 { font-size: 66px; margin-bottom: 40px; }
